ventilasi udara ke fasilitas Umbrella.

222
00:30:23,071 --> 00:30:24,118
Seperti ditinggalkan.

223
00:30:24,531 --> 00:30:26,158
Memang itu siasat mereka.

224
00:30:26,700 --> 00:30:29,419
Ayo jalan!
Kita hanya punya 2 jam..

225
00:30:29,578 --> 00:30:30,921
<i>membawa Alice dan Ada.</i>

226
00:30:31,079 --> 00:30:34,299
<i>Setelah itu kita akan menghadapi pasukan bersenjata Umbrella.</i>

227
00:30:46,887 --> 00:30:47,683
Menjalankan bypass.

228
00:30:52,434 --> 00:30:53,151
Ini..

229
00:30:53,310 --> 00:30:54,357
Kode akses dari Ada.

230
00:30:54,895 --> 00:30:55,737
Kau percaya padanya?

231
00:30:55,896 --> 00:30:57,364
Masukkan saja angkanya.

232
00:31:03,070 --> 00:31:04,743
Peledak sudah terpasang.

233
00:31:08,075 --> 00:31:08,997
Kita masuk!

234
00:31:25,550 --> 00:31:27,223
Ayo selesaikan ini.

235
00:31:28,303 --> 00:31:29,850
Mereka sudah masuk.

236
00:31:30,013 --> 00:31:33,608
<i>Tim penyerang sudah amankan lift pelarianmu ke permukaan..</i>

237
00:31:33,767 --> 00:31:35,735
Mereka akan menghabisi perlawanan Umbrella,

238
00:31:35,894 --> 00:31:37,396
Lalu bertemu kita

239
00:31:37,562 --> 00:31:38,779
dan membawa kita keluar,

240
00:31:39,106 --> 00:31:40,198
Ada temanmu..

241
00:31:40,357 --> 00:31:41,529
...diantara mereka..

242
00:31:41,691 --> 00:31:43,193
Luther West.

243
00:31:43,360 --> 00:31:44,862
Dia masih hidup?

244
00:31:45,278 --> 00:31:47,531
Baik, bertahanlah para gadis.

245
00:31:55,288 --> 00:31:58,963
Cocokkan jam, 2 jam tepatnya..

246
00:31:59,126 --> 00:32:01,845
3..2..1..Mulai!

247
00:32:08,468 --> 00:32:09,640
Leon...

248
00:32:09,803 --> 00:32:10,599
...kenapa tidak kita gunakan,

249
00:32:10,762 --> 00:32:11,684
peledak jarak jauh?

250
00:32:12,180 --> 00:32:14,103
Kita tidak bisa ambil resiko dengan sinyalnya,

251
00:32:14,641 --> 00:32:18,862
berhasil atau tidak, fasilitas ini harus dihancurkan.

252
00:32:20,105 --> 00:32:22,199
Bagaimana jika butuh waktu lebih dari 2 jam?

253
00:32:22,357 --> 00:32:24,985
Kuharap kau bisa menahan nafas dengan baik.

254
00:32:26,736 --> 00:32:30,741
<i>Kepala keamanan Valentine sudah mencapai lokasi pengujian Tokyo,</i>

255
00:32:30,907 --> 00:32:31,749
<i>Dia melacak...</i>

256
00:32:31,908 --> 00:32:32,784
<i>...dirimu.</i>

257
00:32:32,951 --> 00:32:34,578
Mereka menuju kemari.

258
00:32:35,203 --> 00:32:37,126
<i>Perintahnya menangkapmu kembali,...</i>

259
00:32:37,289 --> 00:32:38,415
<i>...jika bisa...</i>

260
00:32:38,582 --> 00:32:41,256
<i>...membunuhmu jika diperlukan.</i>

261
00:32:41,418 --> 00:32:43,216
Siapa yang memerintahkan?

262
00:32:43,378 --> 00:32:44,504
<i>Red Queen.</i>

263
00:32:44,671 --> 00:32:46,594
- Si komputer?
- Ya.

264
00:32:46,756 --> 00:32:50,226
<i>Ya, sama dengan mahakarya di Hive..</i>

265
00:32:50,385 --> 00:32:53,730
<i>Dia sekarang mengontrol sisa dari Umbrella Corporation,.</i>

266
00:32:53,889 --> 00:32:57,189
<i>Dia akan melakukan segalanya untuk mencegahmu lolos ke permukaan.</i>

267
00:32:57,934 --> 00:32:58,730
Aku sudah merencanakan..

268
00:32:58,894 --> 00:33:00,191
<i>...jalur pelarianmu.</i>

269
00:33:00,353 --> 00:33:03,106
<i>Kau akan menyeberangi New York..
menuju Suburbia...</i>

270
00:33:03,273 --> 00:33:05,492
<i>...dimana disana kau akan bertemu tim penyerang...</i>

271
00:33:05,650 --> 00:33:08,529
<i>Mereka akan membawamu melewati Moskow...</i>

272
00:33:08,695 --> 00:33:10,697
<i>...ke pangkalan kapal selam...</i>

273
00:33:10,864 --> 00:33:13,208
<i>Dan naik lift kembali ke permukaan..</i>

274
00:33:13,492 --> 00:33:15,995
<i>Red Queen telah menggangu sinyalku,</i>

275
00:33:16,161 --> 00:33:19,085
<i>Dia berusaha mengontrol fasilitas pengendali..</i>

276
00:33:19,247 --> 00:33:20,590
<i>Kau harus cepat, aku tak bisa...</i>

277
00:33:22,959 --> 00:33:24,802
<i>Jangan dengar penghianat Wesker,</i>

278
00:33:25,420 --> 00:33:27,093
<i>Aku sekarang yang mengontrol..</i>

279
00:33:27,380 --> 00:33:28,256
<i>Projek Alice...</i>

280
00:33:28,548 --> 00:33:29,390
<i>...Ada Wong...</i>

281
00:33:29,549 --> 00:33:30,971
...tetaplah ditempatmu.

282
00:33:31,343 --> 00:33:32,936
<i>- Ayo bergerak.
- Projek Alice...</i>

283
00:33:35,096 --> 00:33:37,224
<i>Kalian semua akan mati dibawah sini!</i>

284
00:33:37,933 --> 00:33:40,061
Aku sudah pernah mendengar itu.

285
00:33:41,086 --> 00:33:50,286
F a h  m  i  A k
h t t p  : //id f l. u  s

286
00:34:01,915 --> 00:34:03,667
Formasi bertahan..

287
00:34:04,876 --> 00:34:05,843
Kunci target kalian..

288
00:34:06,211 --> 00:34:07,554
siap menembak.

289
00:34:23,895 --> 00:34:26,068
Pangkalan kapal selam ada di depan.

290
00:34:28,692 --> 00:34:31,366
Barry, kau dan aku di depan.

291
00:34:32,779 --> 00:34:35,874
Kita bertemu Alice dan Ada 30 menit ke depan.

292
00:34:53,049 --> 00:34:54,392
Aman!

293
00:35:01,558 --> 00:35:03,185
Sekarang ada beberapa hardware!

294
00:35:03,351 --> 00:35:04,227
Kelas Typhoon,

295
00:35:04,853 --> 00:35:07,777
