296
00:35:07,939 --> 00:35:12,115
Umbrella menggunakan itu untuk mengangkut Senjata Bio ke seluruh dunia diam-diam

297
00:35:12,277 --> 00:35:15,076
Ayo bergegas, waktu kita kurang dari 90 menit.

298
00:35:15,238 --> 00:35:17,036
<i>Penyusup terdeteksi,</i>

299
00:35:17,198 --> 00:35:18,450
<i>target harus dihentikan.</i>

300
00:35:23,496 --> 00:35:25,123
New York.

301
00:35:25,332 --> 00:35:27,255
Kita perlu menyeberangi 2 lagi,

302
00:35:27,417 --> 00:35:29,044
lingkungan ujicoba untuk lolos.

303
00:35:29,210 --> 00:35:29,927
Ayo jalan!

304
00:35:30,086 --> 00:35:32,259
Kenapa Umbrella terus melanjutkan tes ini?

305
00:35:32,422 --> 00:35:35,892
Mereka ingin belajar biohazard, bagaimana mengontrolnya.

306
00:35:36,051 --> 00:35:38,804
<i>Memulai tahapan New York,.</i>

307
00:35:38,970 --> 00:35:41,348
<i>mengaktifkan biohazard..</i>

308
00:35:44,100 --> 00:35:47,980
<i>Stand by. Stand by.</i>

309
00:35:48,146 --> 00:35:51,241
<i>Tahapan New York dimulai!.</i>

310
00:35:51,399 --> 00:35:52,241
Red Queen.

311
00:35:52,400 --> 00:35:53,617
dia mengaktifkan,

312
00:35:53,777 --> 00:35:55,825
senjata bio untuk menghentikan kita.
Ayo pergi!

313
00:35:55,987 --> 00:35:57,239
Tunggu!

314
00:35:58,156 --> 00:35:59,408
Kau dengar itu?

315
00:36:08,625 --> 00:36:09,626
Kau tahu apa itu?

316
00:36:10,335 --> 00:36:11,882
Aku punya ide.

317
00:36:30,438 --> 00:36:32,315
Oh, kau pasti bercanda!

318
00:38:05,950 --> 00:38:06,746
Hei nak..

319
00:38:09,412 --> 00:38:10,379
Ide buruk!

320
00:38:30,558 --> 00:38:31,525
Ayo jalan!

321
00:38:32,227 --> 00:38:34,321
Kita telat dari jadwal.

322
00:38:47,283 --> 00:38:48,830
Ada apa?

323
00:38:48,993 --> 00:38:51,212
Ini tahapan akhir,

324
00:38:51,371 --> 00:38:53,499
sering tidak lebih dari sejam.

325
00:38:53,665 --> 00:38:54,962
Ayo..

326
00:38:56,042 --> 00:38:58,886
sebelum Red Quenn mengaktifkan makhluk lain,

327
00:38:59,879 --> 00:39:02,098
<i>Target selamat,</i>

328
00:39:02,257 --> 00:39:05,136
<i>Kepala Keamanan Valentine akan menghentikan mereka.</i>

329
00:39:05,718 --> 00:39:08,767
<i>Penyusup memasuki lingkungan tes Moskow,</i>

330
00:39:08,930 --> 00:39:11,683
<i>Mengaktifkan mayat hidup Los Plagos..</i>

331
00:39:21,985 --> 00:39:23,453
Ada apa?

332
00:39:23,611 --> 00:39:27,115
Red Queen mengetahui kehadiran kita disini, tetaplah waspada.

333
00:39:27,282 --> 00:39:30,877
<i>Stand by. Stand by.</i>

334
00:39:31,035 --> 00:39:33,208
<i>Tahapan Moskow dimulai.</i>

335
00:39:37,500 --> 00:39:40,094
- Apa?
- Dengar!

336
00:39:46,217 --> 00:39:46,888
Di sebelah sana!

337
00:39:56,227 --> 00:39:58,025
Makhluk-makhluk apa itu?

338
00:40:03,276 --> 00:40:05,495
Mundur!

339
00:40:28,551 --> 00:40:29,848
Awan-awan.

340
00:40:30,678 --> 00:40:32,180
Itu bukan nyata,

341
00:40:32,347 --> 00:40:34,645
hanya proyeksi holografik..

342
00:40:35,558 --> 00:40:37,652
Ketika mereka melakukan simulasi..

343
00:40:37,810 --> 00:40:41,155
Percayalah, jangan ada yang melihat ke langit.

344
00:40:47,779 --> 00:40:49,406
Ini titik pertemuannya,

345
00:40:50,323 --> 00:40:51,745
tim penyerang terlambat,

346
00:40:52,617 --> 00:40:53,368
dimana mereka?

347
00:40:55,286 --> 00:40:57,880
Ada seseorang di rumah belakangmu..

348
00:40:58,039 --> 00:40:59,916
Jendela lantai atas.

349
00:41:24,232 --> 00:41:26,109
Kenapa mereka ada disini?

350
00:41:33,950 --> 00:41:35,952
Mereka menggunakan kloninganku.

351
00:41:36,452 --> 00:41:37,704
Tentu saja!

352
00:41:37,870 --> 00:41:39,838
Kau hanya salah satu dari 50 model dasar.

353
00:41:42,083 --> 00:41:44,336
"Model dasar."

354
00:41:44,502 --> 00:41:48,177
Pikirmu bagaimana Umbrella menjalankan skenario tes ini?

355
00:41:48,339 --> 00:41:50,341
Ratusan orang mati, setiap kali..

356
00:41:50,508 --> 00:41:51,725
mereka menjalankan simulasi..

357
00:41:51,884 --> 00:41:54,979
Umbrella menanamkan mereka ingatan dasar..

358
00:41:55,138 --> 00:41:58,142
Cukup untuk memastikan respon emosional..

359
00:41:58,307 --> 00:42:00,150
terhadap ancaman biohazard.

360
00:42:00,685 --> 00:42:02,028
Di kehidupan lain, dia bisa menjadi..

361
00:42:02,186 --> 00:42:03,403
ibu rumah tangga di pinggiran kota,

362
00:42:03,563 --> 00:42:05,941
berikutnya pengusaha wanita di New York..

363
00:42:06,107 --> 00:42:09,486
Lalu tentara yang bekerja untuk Umbrella.

364
00:43:29,482 --> 00:43:30,153
Ibu.

365
00:43:31,150 --> 00:43:31,821
Aku bersembunyi,

366
00:43:31,984 --> 00:43:33,281
..seperti katamu.

367
00:43:37,615 --> 00:43:39,117
Apa yang terjadi dengan pakaian..

368
00:43:39,283 --> 00:43:40,660
dan rambutmu?

369
00:44:25,746 --> 00:44:27,089
RPG! Tiarap!

370
00:44:32,003 --> 00:44:33,425
Kita kehabisan waktu..!

371
00:44:34,005 --> 00:44:36,053
Kau harus mencari jalan keluar sekarang!

372
00:44:36,841 --> 00:44:38,263
Sedikit lagi!

373
00:44:56,986 --> 00:44:58,488
Tidak satupun ini yang nyata.

374
00:44:58,988 --> 00:45:00,831
- Tapi dia ada.
- Aku tahu.

375
00:45:00,990 --> 00:45:02,116
Itu tujuannya.

376
00:45:02,283 --> 00:45:06,129
Semua perasaan ini dibuat untukmu, mereka sudah diprogram.

377
00:45:07,538 --> 00:45:08,664
Sehari lalu,

378
00:45:08,831 --> 00:45:10,629
