393
00:46:27,326 --> 00:46:27,997
Tetap menunduk!

394
00:47:12,955 --> 00:47:14,047
Maju secara bersama!

395
00:47:14,206 --> 00:47:15,378
Ya, ma'am!

396
00:47:22,381 --> 00:47:23,052
Kau tak bisa...

397
00:47:23,215 --> 00:47:24,182
...diam disini!

398
00:47:24,675 --> 00:47:26,552
Ini akan menunjukkanmu jalan keluar..

399
00:47:27,136 --> 00:47:28,558
Lewati Moskow ke..

400
00:47:28,721 --> 00:47:29,472
pangkalan selam,

401
00:47:30,222 --> 00:47:30,939
ambil ini,

402
00:47:32,099 --> 00:47:33,100
Semakin sedikit punyaku..

403
00:47:33,267 --> 00:47:34,735
itu lebih baik.

404
00:47:35,811 --> 00:47:37,688
Tim Alpha maju!

405
00:48:00,419 --> 00:48:01,636
Mereka datang. Cepat.

406
00:48:01,796 --> 00:48:03,048
Ayo.

407
00:48:53,097 --> 00:48:53,814
Aku dapat!

408
00:48:53,973 --> 00:48:54,724
lewat sini!

409
00:49:02,940 --> 00:49:04,408
Hei.

410
00:49:05,067 --> 00:49:05,943
Tunggu.

411
00:49:06,110 --> 00:49:07,578
dia yang membantu kita, ibu tak ingat?

412
00:49:08,779 --> 00:49:09,951
Kalian berdua selamat!

413
00:49:12,741 --> 00:49:13,958
Kukira hanya aku..

414
00:49:14,118 --> 00:49:14,869
yang selamat.

415
00:49:15,035 --> 00:49:17,959
Tempat apa ini dan kenapa semua berbahasa Rusia?

416
00:49:18,122 --> 00:49:20,625
Dan ada apa dengan S & M getup?

417
00:49:21,584 --> 00:49:22,255
Kau tahu...

418
00:49:22,418 --> 00:49:23,761
